### 1. 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

### 2. 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user2@example.com",
  "password": "Test123!"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("authToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 3. 프로필 설정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser",
  "nickname": "테스트유저",
  "description": "안녕하세요",
  "interests": ["게임", "독서"]
}

### 4. 채팅방 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/chatrooms
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "테스트 채팅방",
  "userIds": []
}

> {%
    client.global.set("chatroomId", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 5. 채팅방 목록 조회 (N+1 테스트)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chatrooms
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. 메시지 목록 조회 (N+1 테스트)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/chats/1?page=0&size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. 내 프로필 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}